              "id": "CVE-2020-24584",
              "name": "LanguageSpecificPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "django: permission escalation in intermediate-level directories of the file system cache on Python 3.7+"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "An issue was discovered in Django 2.2 before 2.2.16, 3.0 before 3.0.10, and 3.1 before 3.1.1 (when Python 3.7+ is used). The intermediate-level directories of the filesystem cache had the system's standard umask rather than 0o077."
